#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:3
#: 94e1009e2b984d378773ec0a9a67343b
msgid "Local Solvation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:5
#: ea237b8a98f943269038cbe91a887df2
msgid "`Group`: `Organic` | `Class`: `LocalSolvationCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:7
#: 5600e4f9374448e8937b290a9275d40a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:9
#: 91fe8a5260cb4f128c065071d290fb0c
msgid ""
"`Local Solvation` "
"在选中原子周围插入一批溶剂分子，用来补充离子水合壳、局部极性环境、溶质附近初始溶剂排布等候选构型。它只生成几何初态，不做力场或 DFT 优化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:11
#: 76cd402da571499db3517d6a28284bf5
msgid ""
"这张卡保留输入结构，并追加溶剂原子；输出会写入 `SolvLocal(...)` 标签，便于后续在 `NEP Dataset Display` "
"中筛选。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:13
#: 34b33a8a06a0429da475da81ed6d6c31
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:15
#: 57aae5537c4c4619a7fa7f55e6b387ad
msgid "场景：模型没有见过离子第一水合壳"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:17
#: 11dc5dffecf141eea808631c9457f11d
msgid ""
"你训练了含 Ca 的体系，但训练集里 Ca 周围几乎都是干结构。模型在含水环境里预测 Ca-O 局部相互作用时异常。先用 `Local "
"Solvation` 选中 Ca 原子，插入 4-8 个水分子，生成候选水合壳，再经过几何检查和 DFT 松弛。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:19
#: bd754f8ff9bc4fe89325c7bc90865d03
msgid ""
"参数设置：`center_mode=\"elements\"`，`center_elements=\"Ca\"`，`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`solvent_count=6`，`shell=(2.6,"
" 3.4)`，`min_distance=0.8`，打开 `use_seed`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:21
#: 0b059f49ca7e4e6191890c81b584ab05
msgid "检查输出时重点看 Ca-O 距离、短 H-H/O-H 非键接触、以及 DFT 松弛后是否仍保持合理水合结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:23
#: fdf828c0477041f1b8e19462316dee66
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:25
#: ce568e407d004e0dab2402404aeb0c78
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:27
#: b7f87d29c7c54799a2f92186d3c436ae
msgid "Solvent XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:29
#: dcea0101d86b4aacafbc9e2c2964e835
msgid "`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存的是溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径，因此 card JSON 可以脱离原始文件复现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:31
#: f08a5b975cbc437c8f44941610371072
msgid "Structures（structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:33
#: 2b93367a6dfb4e3d8aeb5d63c72a7358
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立溶剂化版本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:35
#: 6a6ef369d49e4ea190f69279ca997f97
msgid "Solvent Count（solvent_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:37
#: a973d808cd3440b18916f9671156c6d4
msgid "`int`，默认 30。每个输出结构插入多少个溶剂分子。离子第一壳通常从 4-8 开始；大分子局部溶剂环境再按中心原子数量扩大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:39
#: d43b622e82df4738b6e1269e381f1aea
msgid "Sampling Mode（sampling_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:41
#: 9dfdae427aa64168b7e7f09576468e3e
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`ion-"
"water`、`loose`、`dense`。`auto` 会在水分子和离子中心同时出现时使用 `ion-water`，只有水分子时使用 "
"`water`，否则使用 `general`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:43
#: 4ee7ca2eae874ec99dce3520fd8c8b17
msgid "中心原子选择"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:45
#: 225ccc7d9fde4ba786d321ce3ba07c68
msgid "Center Mode（center_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:47
#: 88e21fc71f7b4ed0b7e9d7f3e3f3f7d1
msgid "`str`，默认 `all`。可选 `all`、`elements`、`indices`、`z_range`。这决定哪些原子作为局部溶剂化中心。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:49
#: 46a1dd292977476f9b6a5f168ac21382
msgid "Center Elements（center_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:51
#: 24350c1cd89144f5bd1f1b8cc663d620
msgid "`str`，默认空。`center_mode=\"elements\"` 时生效，例如 `Ca,Na,O`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:53
#: e768fcf196af410cbd0f44e75dcfc573
msgid "Center Indices（center_indices）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:55
#: 0abf7f348ea64f92b3e699c80dff71db
msgid "`str`，默认空。`center_mode=\"indices\"` 时生效，使用 1-based 索引和范围，例如 `1,3,5-8`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:57
#: 3ed97c2f1aa64c029946585cd4918b5b
msgid "Z Range（z_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:59
#: 8d545655cae14ce5a79f2e76cadd2039
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0)`。`center_mode=\"z_range\"` 时按笛卡尔 z "
"坐标选择中心原子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:61
#: 38408763c9ba4e839d34cd400e719669
msgid "几何约束"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:63
#: f2a3d479e31b4f2a935e4172001ab639
msgid "Shell（shell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:65
#: 74f04ac907c742e8a1f9daf1e045cfb2
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(2.2, 4.5)`，单位 "
"Å。局部溶剂中心到溶剂分子参考位置的采样壳层。外半径必须大于内半径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:67
#: c75f01c9097948b68ff4b8e55edb69a8
msgid "Min Distance（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:69
#: 694d69077bdd456a8397078e57d04a56
msgid "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞半径和 `collision_scale`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:71
#: 47fbd5922d724436822f24889c153dfc
msgid "Collision Scale（collision_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:73
#: 4fe17641409b4df3beeeb17e7a03837d
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 "
"时覆盖模式默认值。它控制插入溶剂与已有原子之间的非键接触下限。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:75
#: 8d8ec612277c49d288662909c7f44278
msgid "Max Attempts（max_attempts）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:77
#: fdff69b35a6940a1a5a9b34892cb387b
msgid "`int`，默认 3000。每个输出结构的最大插入尝试次数。达到上限仍插不满时，`strict_count=True` 会报错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:79
#: 8cc98276bf4544f7a6329fa1624ec233
msgid "Strict Count（strict_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:81
#: 42aec4d60e624518b5b946e7cc9333ff
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满 `solvent_count` 就失败；关闭后允许输出部分插入结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:83
#: 613f855ee5e24f36b17da334f7433f5c
msgid "非周期输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:85
#: 0fd2e4b23d2c48deaa59787cfe0a35fe
msgid "Auto Box（auto_box）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:87
#: 2dc85ee544cf4b9399146615e119c421
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后按输出坐标自动生成非周期盒子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:89
#: a41bc4b6c2e1424b8a6f6962da8dd59f
msgid "Fixed Box Size（box_size）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:91
#: 748af1dda3e144d19538429c4b4bf530
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 100.0，单位 Å。输入没有有效 cell 且 `auto_box=False` "
"时，输出会居中放入这个固定盒子；这对应原脚本的 `-box` 默认行为。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:93
#: d28793593ba94fbf813a0ae4e1df6710
msgid "Box Padding（box_padding）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:95
#: 772999cb14be44d4ab698a7bd9ce007e
msgid "`float`，默认 8.0，单位 Å。`auto_box=True` 时在坐标包围盒外增加的边距。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:97
#: 992c6e058feb40d689c9ae74f8414c2b
msgid "Min Box（min_box）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:99
#: d4c2272137264eadb7e62ffe84a12ed5
msgid "`float`，默认 0.0，单位 Å。`auto_box=True` 时每条盒边的最小长度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:101
#: 7c7a48f4d14f49c88c176834095938b9
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:103
#: 428b5d632b1c48bbb082ad4c1176fb8c
msgid "Flex Solvent（flex_solvent）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:105
#: 6847afe062834b249dd9264eed18969b
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，再用于插入。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:107
#: 132098559fc34b04ba7af35e1eaeb4cb
msgid "Flex Pool（flex_pool）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:109
#: 007cc426e6f84173973d0f25e2372af0
msgid "`int`，默认 32。柔性溶剂构象池大小。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:111
#: ba5446d95b1c4579984d0afd34fc0b5f
msgid "Flex Torsion Range（flex_torsion_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:113
#: d4274b7d70394694b587514ad68ce998
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时的扭转角范围。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:115
#: 1e79b50f51a64c8bad80f0c25d0088df
msgid "Flex Max Torsions（flex_max_torsions）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:117
#: 439d2dc706364310b02140fba6cce78a
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:119
#: 38fe32df28c646cf98a3aa855dd01588
msgid "Flex Gaussian Sigma（flex_gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:121
#: 85f9642370a943639dbd725949a62032
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:123
#: e3df5a55c5dc4c9eba4c5fc00b60df8b
msgid "随机性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:125
#: 15fe0e77505b48099b30145472e9edc5
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:127
#: 52ddb7d3d0b04730a8eeed45f7fd091d
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后，同一输入结构、参数和 seed 会生成相同输出。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:129
#: 8c94b131a3b249099157657316e16ed7
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:131
#: 9cc1c510c5964907be401c501ff86604
msgid "`int`，默认 0。`use_seed=True` 时生效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:133
#: 59926f68c7404569be4a727a8854b83b
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:135
#: 4e82cf26af5a4a96a80e8cbfc19e2f99
