msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:178
#: 9113d294aad14adbb520bd9612e3eedb
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:180
#: 5ba80f405c3a43ed8b69e2ce8b96f90d
msgid "`Local Solvation → Geometry Filter`：先生成局部溶剂环境，再剔除短接触或异常体积结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:181
#: 437943f4fecb4e508d7fda1a4b1637d8
msgid "`Local Solvation → FPS Filter`：局部溶剂化批量生成后抽代表结构送 DFT。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:183
#: 052953d0e81946788e1ceecdbbd57a91
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:185
#: bafe10328d144d04a519f46103677a13
msgid ""
"没有选到中心原子：检查 `center_mode` 是否和 `center_elements`、`center_indices` 或 "
"`z_range` 匹配。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:186
#: 39901c220ca5428984596a290036f7a9
msgid ""
"一直插不满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count`，放宽 `shell`，减小 `min_distance` 或 "
"`collision_scale`；如果目标是周期整盒溶剂，优先改用 `Solvent Box Fill`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:187
#: 67d98f16e711454dab724cd71709f7e6
msgid ""
"输出有明显短接触：增大 `min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`，再接 `Geometry Filter` 和 "
"DFT/MD 预松弛。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:189
#: 910825c5745545fe8bb216b7325e39a9
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:191
#: 85519a5867e748608c2a8d17b34a8013
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SolvLocal(mode={mode},n={placed},sel={center_count})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:193
#: 1b6b26ece8ad4ae59a376df7d7f0e420
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:195
#: e16f1903882c460c89cae7dd2ce2ca2f
msgid ""
"打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` "
"会生成相同插入结果。若输入结构顺序、中心原子集合或溶剂分子文本发生变化，输出也会随之变化。"
msgstr ""
